title: "pacific-flexure-window-dependence: window-free recovery of flexural parameters at circum-Pacific trenches"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived per-segment data for the physics-informed neural inversion of
  bending profiles at twenty circum-Pacific subduction margins, together with the
  windowed least-squares baseline against which the analysis-window dependence is
  measured.
